  "helpTitle": "How to play Popzuno",
  "helpOne": "1. Swap a block with its left, right, upper or lower neighbour. Make a horizontal/vertical line of at least 3, or a 2×2 square of the same face. Invalid moves return. Tapping two neighbours also works.",
  "helpTwo": "2. In one swap: 2×2 square → Bomb; horizontal 4 → Rocket; vertical 4 → Shuffle; L/T → Cross; straight 5+ → Nova. Only the strongest power is earned: Nova > Cross > Rocket > Shuffle > Bomb. Cascades and powers do not add inventory.",
  "helpThree": "3. Rush: survive the rising board. Blitz 60: 60 seconds, no rising; the board refills after each move. Ascend: clear each face target, advance a stage and earn a gift power. Daily 90: a fixed puzzle for each UTC day, 90 seconds to score.",
  "helpFour": "4. Keep successful moves within 3.2 seconds to reach ×5. Match 30 faces to earn 6 seconds of Overdrive: double points and frozen rising. Resolution animations preserve the chain window; timed modes keep counting down.",
  "helpFive": "5. Aim Bomb, Rocket and Cross at a block. Nova clears the board; Shuffle rearranges it without removing faces. Stack 99 Novas and 2 of each other power. If no valid shuffle is found, it is not spent. Photos and mode records stay on your device.",
  "keys": "Swipe or tap neighbours. Keyboard: arrows select, Shift + arrow swaps; 1 Bomb, 2 Rocket, 3 Cross, 4 Nova; Enter targets; Space raises; P pauses. · 5 Shuffle",
  "music": "Circuit Bloom — 118–178 BPM. Tempo follows game speed and stages. Pressure, chains and the countdown intensify the drums. Music and effects use separate audio mixes.",
