  "helpTime": "Time Rush: start at 30 seconds, bank up to 60. A triple adds 2s; bigger matches add more. Cascades earn half time, capped at 8s per move. Power clears and Shuffle add no time. The clock drains faster every 30 seconds and more faces appear. Start with one Shuffle; zero ends the run.",
